          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "select\n  time_bucket('1 day', timestamp, 'Europe/Zagreb') as time,\n  max((data->>'activeEnergyTotalImportT1_Wh')::float8)\n    - min((data->>'activeEnergyTotalImportT1_Wh')::float8) as \"Tariff 1\",\n  max((data->>'activeEnergyTotalImportT2_Wh')::float8)\n    - min((data->>'activeEnergyTotalImportT2_Wh')::float8) as \"Tariff 2\"\nfrom measurements\nwhere source in ($device)\n  and timestamp >= time_bucket('1 day', $__timeFrom()::timestamptz, 'Europe/Zagreb')\n  and timestamp < $__timeTo()\ngroup by 1\norder by 1"
